<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: List of scheduled AGMs of Czech main market firms.</title>
<headline>List of scheduled AGMs of Czech main market firms.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of annual general meetings (AGM) of Czech companies whose shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Dates of AGMs displayed in small letters are preliminary and can be changed. Deadline dates of share ownership entitling shareholders to vote at the respective AGMs are in brackets.</p>
<p> Company:					AGM Date:</p>
<p> IF ZIVNOBANKA		  May 23  (May 18)</p>
<p> BIOCEL PASKOV		   JUNE 6  (MAY 30)</p>
<p> CESKA POJISTOVNA		JUNE 24 (JUNE 17)</p>
<p> CESKA SPORITELNA		MAY 22  (MAY 15)</p>
<p> CESKE RADIOKOMUNIKACE	 June 27</p>
<p> CEZ				 June 19</p>
<p> COKOLADOVNY		     June 30 (June 23)</p>
<p> DEZA				JUNE 12 (JUNE 5)</p>
<p> ELEKTRARNY OPATOVICE	  JUNE 20 (JUNE 17)</p>
<p> IF BOHATSTVI		   MAY 20  (MAY 13)</p>
<p> IPB				 June 26 (June 19)</p>
<p> IPF KOMERCNI BANKY	   JUNE 6  (MAY 31)</p>
<p> IPS PRAHA			 JUNE 13 (JUNE 6)</p>
<p> JIHOCESKA ENERGETIKA	  June 27 (June 24)</p>
<p> JIHOMORAVSKA ENERGETIKA     June 30 (June 23)</p>
<p> KOMERCNI BANKA		  MAY 26  (MAY 19)</p>
<p> METROSTAV			 MAY 26  (MAY 19)</p>
<p> MORAVSKE CHEMICKE ZAVODY    MAY 22  (MAY 15)</p>
<p> MORAVSKOSLEZSKE TEPLARNY    MAY 30  (MAY 23)</p>
<p>MOSTECKA UHELNA SPOLECNOST  July 11  PIVOVAR RADEGAST		JUNE 19 (JUNE 12)</p>
<p> PRAZSKA ENERGETIKA	    June 17 (June 11)</p>
<p> PRAZSKA TEPLARENSKA	   June 28 (June 21)</p>
<p> PVT				 JUNE 20 (JUNE 14)</p>
<p> RENTIERSKY IF		  JUNE 18 (JUNE 11)</p>
<p> RIF				  JUNE 13 (JUNE 7)</p>
<p> SEPAP			     MAY 27  (MAY 20)</p>
<p> SEVEROCESKA ENERGETIKA	June 27</p>
<p> SEVEROCESKE DOLY		June 20 (June 13)</p>
<p> SEVEROMORAVSKA ENERGETIKA   June 24 (June 17)</p>
<p> SKODA			     June 18 (June 11)</p>
<p> SPT TELECOM		     June 20</p>
<p> STREDOCESKA ENERGETICKA     Aug 29  (Aug 22)</p>
<p> SYNTHESIA			 June 27 (June 20)</p>
<p> VERTEX			    June 26</p>
<p> VODNI STAVBY PRAHA	    June 24</p>
<p> VYCHODOCESKA ENERGETIKA     JUNE 19 (JUNE 12)</p>
<p> YSE				MAY 16  (MAY 9)</p>
<p> ZAPADOCESKA ENERGETIKA	June 30 (June 24)</p>
<p> ZIVNOSTENSKA BANKA	    JUNE 2  (MAY 27)</p>
<p>Note: Investment fund Sporitelni Privatizacni Investicni Fond Cesky a.s. has not announced the date of its AGM. Chemopetrol Group a.s. and Kaucuk Group a.s. had their AGMs in March.</p>
<p>Bank IPB has called an extraordinary general meeting for May 27 to vote on allowing the release of internal information to bidders in a government tender for a 36 percent stake in the bank.</p>
<p>-- Prague newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
